    <briefdescription>
<para>A materialization unit that builds lazy re-exports. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These are callable entry points that call through to the given symbols. Unlike a &apos;true&apos; re-export, the address of the lazy re-export will not match the address of the re-exported symbol, but calling it will behave the same as calling the re-exported symbol. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
